{\b Builder3D - test release}\par
\par
This is a pre-release build of Builder3D, shared for testing. It is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Features may be unfinished and may change.\par
\par
Builder3D installs for your Windows account only and does not need administrator rights. You can remove it at any time from Settings > Apps > Installed apps.\par
\par
Builder3D includes third-party components (Boost, Qhull, the Microsoft Visual C++ runtime and others). Their license notices are installed in the "licenses" folder next to the program.\par
